# === Git (645MB savings) ===
.git
**/.git
**/.gitignore
**/.gitmodules
**/.github

# === Python bytecode ===
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]

# === OS / IDE ===
**/.DS_Store
.vscode
.idea

# === Vendor: strip test suites and CI config (Odoo never loads these) ===
**/tests/
**/test/
**/.travis.yml
**/.pre-commit-config.yaml
**/.pylintrc

# === Vendor: strip translation catalogs and pot templates ===
**/i18n/
**/*.pot

# === Vendor: strip description screenshots (marketing, not runtime) ===
**/static/description/

# === Docs not needed at runtime ===
**/doc/
**/docs/
**/*.md
.weblate.json

# === Local dev artifacts ===
.env
*.log
docker-compose.override.yml
docker-compose.nginx.yml
deploy/
Makefile
